# Allowlist: the server image needs the root manifests, the server, the shared
# package and the mobile manifest (the lockfile covers it). Nothing else.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/server
!apps/mobile/package.json
!packages/shared

# Whatever the above re-included but a build must not take from the host.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.pglite
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
